SUMMARY:Free Class: Doctor039\\\;s Top Recommendations for Health
LOCATION:4620 N. 22nd St. Tampa 33610 Tampa \, FL 33610 United States
DESCRIPTION:Have you ever wondered what doctors wish every patient would d
 o? Heres your chance to find out! Join us for an interactive class about d
 octors top recommendations for patient health. You can use this class to a
 sk questions and get ideas for small steps you can do that will have a BIG
  impact on your overall health and maybe your next checkup. Two TFHC docto
 rs\, Dr. Nguyen and Dr. Kovacevic\, will be available to answer your quest
 ions and guide us in choosing healthy habits. \n\nPermalink: https://www.t
 ampa.gov/node/197396
