SUMMARY:Celebrate Grandmaxing Day
LOCATION:Tampa \, FL United States
DESCRIPTION:Tampa will shine purple the evening of November 14 in honor of
  GrandmaxingDay! Created by Tampas very own Grandma Jan\, Grandmaxing mean
 s making the most of being a grandparent through meaningful connection and
  time together. Join Tampa families in celebrating the bond between grandp
 arents and grandchildren. THREE SIMPLE WAYS TO CELEBRATE 1. Spend time tog
 ether  Take a walk\, share a meal\, read a book\, or play a favorite game.
  2. Share a little of your story  Teach a family recipe\, look at old phot
 os\, or tell a childhood story. 3. Connect from wherever you are  Call\, v
 ideo chat\, or mail a note. Long-distance families can celebrate\, too. Lo
 cal businesses and community organizations: offer a shared activity\, sugg
 est a family outing\, or help spread the word. Find Grandma Jan on all pla
 tforms: heygrandmajan \n\nPermalink: https://www.tampa.gov/node/197766
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.tampa.gov/node/197766
END:VEVENT
