SUMMARY:Christmas in the Wild
LOCATION:11001 W. Sligh Avenue Tampa \, FL 33604 United States
DESCRIPTION:Experience the joy of the holidays at Tampa Bays family-favori
 te tradition\, Christmas in the Wild\, presented by GEICO \, which connect
 s guests together with wildlife and the magic of the season. Nominated by 
 USA Today 10Best Readers Choice Awards 2024 for Best Zoo Lights\, the even
 t begins November 27 and will shine on for 19 select nights through Decemb
 er 30. The popular event transforms the zoo into a luminous spectacle\, fe
 aturing over a million lights\, larger-than-life illuminated animal sculpt
 ures\, and festive music. Guests can explore 17 holiday-themed areas\, enj
 oy six live performances\, and indulge in festive seasonal treats. The cel
 ebration introduces new experiences alongside returning favorites\, ensuri
 ng memorable experiences for both first-time visitors and returning famili
 es. Christmas in the Wild is free for members and Zoo Fun ticket holders. 
 General admission tickets after 4PM are 34.95. NEW Christmas in the Wild E
 xperiences for 2026: Evergreen Falls: Experience a movie scene coming to l
 ife in the magical town of Evergreen Falls featuring decorated home fronts
 \, a tree lot and holiday dcor. Snow Angel Overlook: A frozen blue paradis
 e filled with sparkling lights and special effects where guests can meet t
 he majestic ice angel princess. Expanded Jingle Bell Circle: Kick off the 
 holiday cheer and marvel at a stunning 30 ft. tall Christmas tree sparklin
 g with thousands of brilliantly colored lights choreographed to seasonal m
 usic. Enjoy four continuous musical light shows every hour\, snow and spec
 ial appearances by the Snow Queen. \n\nPermalink: https://www.tampa.gov/no
 de/197991
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.tampa.gov/node/197991
END:VEVENT
