SUMMARY:Artist Romero Britto Appearance at BRITTO in International Plaza
LOCATION:2223 North Westshore Boulevard Tampa \, FL 33607 United States
DESCRIPTION:An unforgettable afternoon of art\, color\, and creativity awa
 its in Tampa this Black Friday! This Black Friday\, step into the vibrant 
 world of Romero Britto \, the internationally celebrated artist known for 
 his bold colors\, playful patterns\, and uplifting works of art. Join us a
 t BRITTO International Plaza for a special artist appearance and signing e
 vent. Whether youre a longtime art enthusiast\, an aspiring collector\, or
  simply looking for a unique experience in Tampa\, this is your opportunit
 y to meet the artist behind the iconic creations. What to Expect Meet Rome
 ro Britto: Enjoy a special in-person appearance by the world-renowned arti
 st. Artist Signing: Experience a special signing opportunity during the ev
 ent. Discover the Art: Explore BRITTOs colorful collection of artwork\, sc
 ulptures\, and gifts. Celebrate Black Friday: Enjoy an afternoon of art\, 
 creativity\, and drinks in a vibrant gallery atmosphere. Check out the vib
 e (https:www.youtube.comwatch?vMj2c3VnIlws) \n\nPermalink: https://www.tam
 pa.gov/node/198036
