SUMMARY:History is a Joke: Theme Parks
LOCATION:801 Water Street Tampa \, FL 33607 United States
DESCRIPTION:In Florida\, theme parks are serious business\, but their hist
 ory can be pretty hilarious. History is a Joke: Theme Parks explores the s
 urprising\, strange and sometimes downright ridiculous history behind the 
 places that made Florida the worlds theme park capital. At History is a Jo
 ke \, join comedians Johnny B\, John J. Murray\, and Matt Fernandez from t
 he 3 Ugly Mugs podcast \, along with the History Centers Rodney Kite-Powel
 l\, as they point out the humorous side of history. This event is 15 and a
 dvance registration is required. Members receive 20 off the listed price. 
 If your plans change and you are unable to attend\, please let us know so 
 we can make your seats available to others who wish to join us. About the 
 3 Ugly Mugs podcast 3 Ugly Mugs brings together local comedians Johnny B\,
  John J. Murray and Matt Fernandez for lively conversations about the NFL\
 , college football\, MLB\, craft beer\, pop culture and local happenings. 
 A Tampa native\, Fernandez is known for his detached\, nonchalant comedic 
 style and has performed alongside some of comedys biggest names\, includin
 g Jim Jefferies\, Bill Burr and Dave Chappelle. Murray brings his self-pro
 claimed Florida Man identity to the conversation\, while Johnny B draws on
  22 years of stand-up comedy and 10 years on air\, finding humor in lifes 
 absurdities\, particularly his own. Together\, the three bring their disti
 nct personalities and comedic perspectives to the microphone. \n\nPermalin
 k: https://www.tampa.gov/node/197721
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.tampa.gov/node/197721
END:VEVENT
