SUMMARY:Holiday Party for Charlotte Lung Cancer Survivors
LOCATION:3751 East Fowler Avenue Tampa \, FL 33612 United States
DESCRIPTION:The LiveLung Tampa chapter is a community for anyone impacted 
 by lung cancersurvivors and care partners alike. We meet in person on the 
 third Wednesday of each month at 11:00 a.m. ET at Holiday Inn Tampa North 
 at 3751 E. Fowler Avenue\, Tampa\, FL 33612. This December\, join us as we
  celebrate the holiday season and reflect on another year of courage\, hop
 e\, and resilience. We would be delighted to spend this special time toget
 her. Enjoy a delicious\, complimentary meal\, a craft project\, festive fu
 n\, and the opportunity to connect with others who share in this unique jo
 urney. Come celebrate the season\, the friendships weve built\, and the st
 rength that carries us forward into the new year. We look forward to celeb
 rating with you! Wed love for you to join us! Free lunch is provided\, so 
 be sure to register and place your order at least 24 hours in advance. Reg
 ister here - https:livelung.linktampa (https:www.google.comurl?qhttps:live
