SUMMARY:Growing Creatively: Early Learner Gallery Art Experience
LOCATION:120 W Gasparilla Plaza Tampa \, FL 33602 United States
DESCRIPTION:Select Wednesdays  9:30-10:30 AM Classes Available  923\, 1021
 \, 1118\, 1216 Ages 2  Beginner-Intermediate Level Growing Creativity: Ear
 ly Leaners Gallery and Art Experience introduces toddlers and caregivers t
 o the joy of making art together. Children ages 2-5 will develop creativit
 y\, curiosity\, and early motor skills by exploring color\, texture\, and 
 movement through hands-on sensory activities and collaborative art making.
  Using safe\, tactile materials such as paint\, natural elements\, and sim
 ple tools\, participants focus on process\, discovery\, and playful experi
 mentation. Each class draws inspiration from a different artwork on view i
 n the Tampa Museum of Art exhibitions. This cost covers the caregiver plus
  1 child Your student is ready for this program if they have met these mil
 estones: Walks and runs confidently Walks upstairs with or without assista
 nce Turns pages in a book one at a time Holds a crayon and scribbles spont
 aneously \n\nPermalink: https://www.tampa.gov/node/193581
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.tampa.gov/node/193581
END:VEVENT
