SEQUENCE:0
DTSTAMP:20261121T000320Z
DTSTART:20270306T160000Z
DTEND:20270306T190000Z
SUMMARY:After the Storm: Free Mold Prevention Workshop for Tampa Homeowner
 s
LOCATION:900 N Ashley Dr Tampa \, FL 33602 United States
DESCRIPTION:Free public workshop for Tampa homeowners\, landlords\, and pr
 operty managers. Learn how to spot mold early after leaks\, storms\, and F
 lorida humidity\, what a professional mold inspection covers\, and when to
  call an independent provider. Hosted by Mold Inspection Remediation Tampa
 \, a free referral service connecting Tampa homeowners with independent mo
 ld inspection and remediation providers. Topics: black mold warning signs\
 , moisture and humidity checks\, water damage cleanup basics\, and live Q 
 A. Serving South Tampa\, Davis Islands\, Ybor City\, Hyde Park\, and Semin
 ole Heights. Free and open to the public. Call (813) 845-8355 for details.
  \n\nPermalink: https://www.tampa.gov/node/197881
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.tampa.gov/node/197881
END:VEVENT
